WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.501 --> 00:00:02.627 line:71%
Well, guys, congratulations.

00:00:03.294 --> 00:00:03.753 line:71%
The two of you are joining us
in the third and final round

00:00:04.129 --> 00:00:05.005 line:71%
of this competition.

00:00:05.505 --> 00:00:06.256 line:71%
In this final round,
we're sending you back

00:00:07.674 --> 00:00:08.466 line:71%
to your home forges
for four days

00:00:10.135 --> 00:00:10.885 line:71%
to build an iconic
weapon from history.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:14.806 line:71%
You're going to
be building this.

00:00:19.978 --> 00:00:20.270 line:71%
Bladesmiths, this
is the Naga sword.

00:00:21.354 --> 00:00:21.646 line:71%
[chuckles]

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:24.274 line:71%
NARRATOR: The Naga
sword traces its origins

00:00:25.650 --> 00:00:26.401 line:71%
back to 16th century India.

00:00:27.819 --> 00:00:28.570 line:71%
Featuring a broad
square-chisel tip,

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:30.572 line:71%
this weapon was
great at inflicting

00:00:32.323 --> 00:00:32.991 line:71%
powerful deadly chops in combat.

00:00:34.034 --> 00:00:34.784 line:71%
This rare version
of the Dao sword

00:00:35.493 --> 00:00:36.661 line:71%
was reserved for
the highest level

00:00:39.497 --> 00:00:40.248 line:71%
tribal authorities due to the
scarcity of iron in the area.

00:00:40.999 --> 00:00:42.125 line:71%
While few Naga
swords still exist,

00:00:44.502 --> 00:00:44.753 line:71%
it can be seen on display in
the halls of the British Museum

00:00:45.587 --> 00:00:45.837 line:71%
in London.

00:00:46.212 --> 00:00:46.796 line:71%
Good luck.

00:00:48.256 --> 00:00:48.590 line:71%
We'll see you in four days.

00:00:49.799 --> 00:00:52.761 line:71%
Let's get it.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:54.512 line:71%
My name's Chris Smith.

00:00:55.930 --> 00:00:57.057 line:7%
I'm 41 years old from
Bergen, Kentucky.

00:01:00.351 --> 00:01:01.019 line:7%
I am a refractory brick mason
and a part-time bladesmith.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:03.354 line:71%
I thoroughly enjoy
making knives.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:04.856 line:71%
It's a lot like a rabbit hole.

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:07.942 line:71%
There's new materials coming
out all the time, new tools.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:10.320 line:71%
And I just enjoy the challenge.

00:01:11.237 --> 00:01:11.821 line:71%
It feels pretty good.

00:01:13.573 --> 00:01:14.365 line:71%
Got all the parameters met.

00:01:16.076 --> 00:01:16.618 line:71%
It's time to heat
treat this thing.

00:01:18.203 --> 00:01:19.037 line:71%
Let's hope this goes well.

00:01:21.039 --> 00:01:21.623 line:71%
There was no crazy
fireballs or broken

00:01:22.540 --> 00:01:22.999 line:71%
blades or anything like that.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:25.126 line:71%
The quench went great.

00:01:26.377 --> 00:01:26.669 line:71%
Yeah, it's hard.

00:01:27.045 --> 00:01:27.754 line:71%
I am stoked.

00:01:28.379 --> 00:01:29.172 line:71%
This thing is going
to look awesome.

00:01:31.091 --> 00:01:31.591 line:71%
I got it ground and
ready for etching.

00:01:32.717 --> 00:01:32.967 line:71%
It's going to look good.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.302 line:71%
[whistles]

00:01:35.553 --> 00:01:36.471 line:71%
The blade etched amazing.

00:01:37.806 --> 00:01:38.389 line:71%
It's time to start
thinking about the handle

00:01:38.973 --> 00:01:39.682 line:71%
and how I'm going to make it.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.684 line:71%
I feel like I have
plenty of time.

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.896 line:71%
I'm doing some research
online about this Naga sword.

00:01:48.775 --> 00:01:49.234 line:71%
The majority that I saw had
red goat hair off the pommel,

00:01:49.734 --> 00:01:50.568 line:71%
just as a decoration.

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.071 line:71%
So I ordered goat
hair off the internet.

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:54.239 line:71%
I think it's perfect.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:01:58.576 line:7%
[music playing]

00:02:00.245 --> 00:02:01.287 line:7%
I'm Joseph, JoJo, Salyers.

00:02:04.457 --> 00:02:05.250 line:7%
I am 19 years old from
Rutherfordton, North Carolina.

00:02:07.168 --> 00:02:08.002 line:71%
I'm a full-time
bladesmith with my dad,

00:02:10.088 --> 00:02:10.588 line:71%
Billy Salyers, who
just so happens to be

00:02:11.589 --> 00:02:12.423 line:71%
a Forged in Fire champion.

00:02:14.342 --> 00:02:14.759 line:71%
Billy, you are the
Forged in Fire champion.

00:02:15.093 --> 00:02:16.094 line:71%
Good job, brother.

00:02:18.763 --> 00:02:19.514 line:71%
And so here I am hoping
I can show the old man up.

00:02:21.224 --> 00:02:23.434 line:71%
Well, it's coming
along pretty well.

00:02:25.145 --> 00:02:25.937 line:71%
We've got a solid
build in Damascus.

00:02:27.772 --> 00:02:28.690 line:71%
It's time to get my
blade in the oil.

00:02:31.359 --> 00:02:32.193 line:71%
With Damascus, you have
a bunch of little welds.

00:02:34.779 --> 00:02:35.613 line:71%
Any of those welds
could possibly pop open.

00:02:38.283 --> 00:02:38.783 line:71%
I'm hoping everything
comes out all good.

00:02:40.535 --> 00:02:44.122 line:71%
All right, hot metal.

00:02:45.290 --> 00:02:45.790 line:71%
My sword's quenched.

00:02:46.166 --> 00:02:46.916 line:71%
It's pretty straight.

00:02:48.376 --> 00:02:49.544 line:71%
All in all, my
blade's mostly done.

00:02:53.464 --> 00:02:54.048 line:71%
Most of the work I have to do
is aesthetics and sharpening.

00:02:55.175 --> 00:02:55.925 line:71%
That is what you like to see.

00:02:57.802 --> 00:02:58.386 line:71%
My dad was kind
enough to give me

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:00.847 line:71%
something to test my blade on.

00:03:03.558 --> 00:03:03.808 line:7%
I present you a challenge
worthy of your skills.

00:03:05.226 --> 00:03:05.810 line:7%
[laughing]

00:03:08.313 --> 00:03:08.646 line:7%
Finally, a worthy opponent.

00:03:10.899 --> 00:03:11.107 line:71%
[music playing]

00:03:11.482 --> 00:03:12.442 line:71%
Yeah.

00:03:14.277 --> 00:03:14.777 line:71%
It shall go on the wall
and we shall stuff it.

00:03:16.196 --> 00:03:16.487 line:71%
My sword's comfy, sharp.

00:03:16.821 --> 00:03:17.906 line:71%
It's done.

00:03:20.825 --> 00:03:21.618 line:71%
Now it's time to go see what
the judges can do with it.

00:03:24.162 --> 00:03:25.330 line:71%
Bladesmiths, welcome
to the kill test.

00:03:26.706 --> 00:03:27.832 line:71%
To find out what kind of lethal
damage your weapons will do,

00:03:30.501 --> 00:03:31.127 line:71%
I'm going to take your weapons
and put some lethal blows

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.004 line:71%
or chops on this pig carcass.

00:03:33.671 --> 00:03:34.464 line:71%
JoJo, are you ready for this?

00:03:35.590 --> 00:03:35.882 line:71%
Let's make some pork chops.
[laughing]

00:03:37.008 --> 00:03:39.636 line:71%
You got it.

00:03:45.058 --> 00:04:00.281 line:71%
[music playing]

00:04:02.700 --> 00:04:03.159 line:71%
All right, JoJo, pork
chops you wanted.

00:04:03.743 --> 00:04:04.702 line:71%
Pork chops you got.

00:04:05.870 --> 00:04:06.955 line:71%
Most of the weight is
right here in the handle.

00:04:09.249 --> 00:04:10.250 line:71%
So that really lends itself
to a nice balanced weapon.

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:13.711 line:71%
Your sword's edge over here
chops deeply, especially

00:04:14.587 --> 00:04:15.088 line:71%
on that one swing on the leg.

00:04:17.548 --> 00:04:17.799 line:71%
And overall, it'll kill.

00:04:18.216 --> 00:04:18.925 line:71%
Awesome.

00:04:19.550 --> 00:04:20.134 line:71%
All right, Chris,
your turn, sir.

00:04:20.802 --> 00:04:21.344 line:71%
Are you ready?
- Yes, sir.

00:04:22.512 --> 00:04:25.014 line:71%
All right, let's do this.

00:04:29.936 --> 00:04:43.574 line:71%
[music playing]

00:04:45.076 --> 00:04:45.493 line:71%
That's what I'm talking about.

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:46.661 line:71%
All right, Chris.

00:04:47.495 --> 00:04:48.288 line:71%
The first thing I
notice about this

00:04:51.082 --> 00:04:51.958 line:71%
is just how sharp
your edge is ground.

00:04:54.919 --> 00:04:56.087 line:71%
And that lends itself
for very deep cuts.

00:04:59.090 --> 00:05:00.091 line:71%
And I like the throwback to the
'90s troll hair right there.

00:05:03.261 --> 00:05:03.636 line:71%
But overall, sir, your
Naga sword, it will kill.

00:05:04.762 --> 00:05:07.181 line:71%
Thank you, sir.

00:05:09.309 --> 00:05:09.767 line:71%
All right, gentlemen,
welcome to the strength

00:05:10.643 --> 00:05:11.769 line:71%
test, the howdah chop.

00:05:13.604 --> 00:05:14.439 line:71%
Now, those howdahs would be
riding on top of an elephant.

00:05:16.566 --> 00:05:17.442 line:71%
But this test is not
about what your Naga

00:05:19.277 --> 00:05:19.694 line:71%
swords do to the howdah,
but what that howdah

00:05:20.111 --> 00:05:20.695 line:71%
does to your blades.

00:05:21.821 --> 00:05:22.113 line:71%
And, JoJo, you are up first.

00:05:22.780 --> 00:05:23.114 line:71%
You ready?

00:05:24.949 --> 00:05:25.325 line:71%
I suppose so.

00:05:29.871 --> 00:05:45.970 line:71%
[music playing]

00:05:49.349 --> 00:05:50.516 line:71%
All right, so JoJo,
there's no damage.

00:05:53.686 --> 00:05:54.604 line:71%
It's a kind of an ax grind, but
on a chopper, it works fine.

00:05:55.980 --> 00:05:56.230 line:71%
It held up beautifully
in the strength test.

00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:57.231 line:71%
Well done.

00:05:57.565 --> 00:05:58.441 line:71%
Thank you.

00:05:59.567 --> 00:05:59.817 line:71%
Chris, you ready to
play with the howdah?

00:06:00.568 --> 00:06:00.818 line:71%
Yes, sir.

00:06:02.487 --> 00:06:02.820 line:71%
All right.

00:06:07.450 --> 00:06:28.513 line:71%
[music playing]

00:06:31.182 --> 00:06:31.474 line:71%
Chris, I'm going to start
back here on your handle.

00:06:31.849 --> 00:06:32.683 line:71%
I like this.

00:06:33.393 --> 00:06:34.560 line:71%
It's got a fairly
traditional look to it.

00:06:37.021 --> 00:06:38.231 line:71%
As far as your blade goes, we
have a little bit of an issue.

00:06:45.196 --> 00:06:46.072 line:71%
Your edge has deflected over to
one side, but it's still sharp.

00:06:47.615 --> 00:06:47.865 line:71%
Other than that, I think
you did a good job.

00:06:48.991 --> 00:06:52.537 line:71%
Well done.

00:06:55.748 --> 00:06:56.374 line:71%
All right, bladesmiths,
welcome to the sharpness test,

00:06:58.167 --> 00:06:59.544 line:71%
the jackfruit and rope slice.

00:07:01.879 --> 00:07:02.171 line:71%
JoJo, you're up first.
You ready for this?

00:07:02.880 --> 00:07:03.172 line:71%
Absolutely.

00:07:03.798 --> 00:07:04.132 line:71%
All right.

00:07:04.882 --> 00:07:05.216 line:71%
Let's do this.

00:07:09.262 --> 00:07:25.069 line:71%
[music playing]

00:07:30.408 --> 00:07:30.741 line:71%
All right, JoJo, your edge
cut nicely on these jackfruits

00:07:31.242 --> 00:07:31.742 line:71%
and the rope.

00:07:34.245 --> 00:07:34.495 line:71%
Overall, it will cut.

00:07:35.079 --> 00:07:35.788 line:71%
Thank you.

00:07:36.414 --> 00:07:36.998 line:71%
All right, Chris,
your turn, sir.

00:07:37.457 --> 00:07:38.040 line:71%
Are you ready?
- Yes, sir.

00:07:39.584 --> 00:07:39.917 line:71%
All right.
Let's do this.

00:07:44.464 --> 00:07:57.602 line:71%
[music playing]

00:08:00.730 --> 00:08:01.606 line:71%
All right, Chris, so in
cutting the jackfruit,

00:08:03.441 --> 00:08:04.400 line:71%
this section right here
met the jackfruits.

00:08:05.776 --> 00:08:06.944 line:71%
So that includes this area
that took some damage.

00:08:08.488 --> 00:08:09.572 line:71%
You can feel a little bit of
a drag, but it did not affect.

00:08:11.449 --> 00:08:12.241 line:71%
It was able to cut through
the jackfruit and the rope.

00:08:15.369 --> 00:08:15.620 line:71%
Overall, sir, your
weapon, it will cut.

00:08:16.913 --> 00:08:17.830 line:71%
Thank you.

00:08:19.123 --> 00:08:20.333 line:71%
Well, bladesmiths, both
your blades tested well,

00:08:22.293 --> 00:08:22.877 line:71%
but only one of you can go home
with a Forged in Fire champion

00:08:24.003 --> 00:08:24.795 line:71%
title and a check for $10,000.

00:08:25.630 --> 00:08:26.255 line:71%
Our judges have
discussed your blades,

00:08:27.298 --> 00:08:28.090 line:71%
and they made a final decision.

00:08:30.259 --> 00:08:33.346 line:71%
Today's Forged in
Fire champion is--

00:08:34.138 --> 00:08:34.514 line:71%
JoJo.

00:08:35.223 --> 00:08:35.932 line:71%
Congratulations.

00:08:37.642 --> 00:08:38.184 line:71%
Chris, there's no
doubting you are

00:08:38.643 --> 00:08:39.769 line:71%
an extremely talented smith.

00:08:40.686 --> 00:08:41.479 line:71%
But unfortunately, your time
in this competition has ended.

00:08:41.979 --> 00:08:42.813 line:71%
I'm going to have
to ask you to please

00:08:43.648 --> 00:08:44.190 line:71%
step off the Forge floor.
- All right.

00:08:44.649 --> 00:08:45.483 line:71%
Thank you all for having me.

00:08:46.567 --> 00:08:46.984 line:71%
Thank you, Chris.
It's a beautiful piece.

00:08:47.652 --> 00:08:47.985 line:71%
Awesome, brother.

00:08:48.653 --> 00:08:48.986 line:71%
Thanks, mate.

00:08:49.362 --> 00:08:50.488 line:71%
Take care, guys.

00:08:51.072 --> 00:08:52.198 line:71%
I think it all came down to
the heat treatment on my blade.

00:08:55.701 --> 00:08:56.160 line:71%
I'm not sure what went wrong,
but something obviously did.

00:08:56.577 --> 00:08:57.620 line:71%
JoJo, congratulations.

00:08:58.496 --> 00:08:59.372 line:71%
That means you are the newest
Forged in Fire champion.

00:09:01.290 --> 00:09:01.958 line:71%
Not only that, you are
the very first father

00:09:02.833 --> 00:09:03.709 line:71%
and son champion
that's ever come

00:09:05.002 --> 00:09:05.253 line:71%
through Forged in Fire, man.
Congratulations.

00:09:05.545 --> 00:09:06.337 line:71%
[applause]

00:09:06.921 --> 00:09:07.838 line:71%
I cannot wait to
get home and tell Dad.

00:09:09.674 --> 00:09:10.258 line:71%
This is going to be super
cool, and he's going

00:09:11.634 --> 00:09:12.385 line:71%
to be just as excited as I am.

00:09:13.844 --> 00:09:14.512 line:71%
Is this a blade
you'll build again?

00:09:15.096 --> 00:09:15.972 line:71%
I think I'll
make an extra one.

00:09:17.598 --> 00:09:17.848 line:71%
I need something to
show off at the house.

00:09:18.516 --> 00:09:18.933 line:71%
[laughter]

00:09:20.518 --> 00:09:21.060 line:71%
This is so awesome.

00:09:22.186 --> 00:09:22.853 line:71%
I never thought I'd be here.

00:09:24.939 --> 00:09:25.690 line:71%
And, man, it's just a blessing.

00:09:27.358 --> 00:09:27.608 line:71%
JoJo's the Forged
in Fire champion.

00:09:28.359 --> 00:09:28.609 line:71%
Let's go.

00:09:29.527 --> 00:09:29.694 line:71%
Up top.

00:09:30.319 --> 00:09:30.695 line:71%
Yeah.

00:09:34.323 --> 00:09:39.323 line:71%
[music playing]

